<div class="two-column"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Actions & feedback</h2></div><div class="component-body"><div class="button-row"><button class="button primary" data-action="Primary action">Primary action</button><button class="button secondary" data-action="Secondary action">Secondary</button><button class="button danger" data-action="Destructive action" data-reason>Destructive</button><button class="button secondary" disabled>Disabled</button></div><div class="button-row"><span class="badge green">Active</span><span class="badge amber">Awaiting review</span><span class="badge red">Failed</span><span class="badge blue">Pending activation</span></div><div class="notice"><x-design.icon name="shield" />Informational message with readable text.</div><div class="inline-error"><strong>Something needs your attention.</strong><p>Use specific guidance to explain the next step.</p></div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Form elements</h2></div><div class="component-body"><label class="field"><span>Display name</span><input placeholder="Enter a name"></label><label class="field"><span>Example field error</span><input aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="example-error" value="Invalid value"><small class="error-text" id="example-error">Explain what needs to change.</small></label><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox"> Example preference</label><div class="empty-example"><x-design.icon name="users" /><h3>No team members yet</h3><p>Your team’s members will appear here.</p></div></div></section></div>
